<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>RECOMMENDED SETTINGS:
Resolution: 1920x1080
DPI: 800-1300 DPI mouse
9-12 Horizontal &amp; Vertical Sensitivity (I use 9 horizontal 11 vertical)
1.0x Magnification: 65
1.5x Magnification: 50
16:10 / 4:9 Aspect Ratio

Works on:
R-4C - Compensator
P90 - Extended Barrel
AK12 - Compensator
Vector - Extended Barrel
C7E - Compensator
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 15 ms
MoveR -2 16
Delay 15 ms
MoveR -1 17
Delay 15 ms
MoveR -1 18
Delay 15 ms
MoveR -2 16
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>